# API keys for the benchmark evaluator
.env

# Note: screenshots/, experiments/ and benchmark_results/ are deliberately
# tracked. Vercel builds from a clone of this repo, so anything the static export
# needs at build time has to be committed — see staticExportPlugin in
# vite.config.js. A deployed build has no /api and cannot run an evaluation, so
# committed results are the only results it can ever show.

